<title>UK: Cypriot bulker grounded in Buenos Aires channel.</title>
<headline>Cypriot bulker grounded in Buenos Aires channel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cypriot bulk carrier Oliver Spirit ran aground at KM 5 in the Buenos Aires port south access channel early on Thursday, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service reported.</p>
<p>The 26,741 dwt vessel is partially obstructing navigation, it said.</p>
</text>
